---
description: Strict TypeScript for MasteryHub editor plugins
globs: "**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript

- No `any`. Narrow `unknown`.
- Explicit return types on functions.
- `public` / `private` on class members.
- Named interfaces/types for parameters and returns. Never inline `{ ... }` on a function signature.
- `import type` for type-only imports.
- No non-null assertions.
- Exhaustive switches on unions.
- Under `exactOptionalPropertyTypes`, omit optional keys instead of passing `undefined` unless the type includes `| undefined`.
- Prettier print width 200. Prefer one line when it fits.
